{"title":"Kollinearität untersuchen (2)","puid":"c-mat-11-algebra/tckpdy","path":"/../c-mat-11-algebra/topic-02-vektoren/block-07-kollineariteat/level-02","type":"normal","voiceLang":"de","instruction":{"voice":"f5_2025","speaker":true,"autoplay":false},"textAlign":"left","hint":{"label":"Hilfe","text":[{"text":"<m-yellow><t-yellow>&nbsp;Grundlagen&nbsp;</m-yellow></t-yellow>&nbsp;Zwei Vektoren <mat>rarrow(u)</mat> und <mat>rarrow(v)</mat> sind <b>kollinear</b> zueinander, wenn ein Vektor ein Vielfaches des anderen Vektors ist. <br>Es gilt also: <mat>rarrow(u) = r * rarrow(v)</mat> oder <mat>rarrow(v) = r * rarrow(u)</mat>"},{"text":"<br><br><b>Beispiele:</b>"},{"text":"<br>Die Vektoren <mat>rarrow(u) = vector(5,12,2)</mat> und <mat> rarrow(v) = vector(2.5,6,1)</mat> sind kollinear zueinander, denn für <mat>r=2</mat> gilt: <br> <mat center='true'>vector(5,12,2) = 2* vector(2.5,6,1)</mat><br><br>Die Vektoren <mat>rarrow(u) = vector(1,2,0)</mat> und <mat> rarrow(v) = vector(4,5,0)</mat> sind <u>nicht</u> kollinear zueinander, da es kein r gibt, so dass gilt: <br><mat center='true'>rarrow(u) = r* rarrow(v)</mat>"}]},"trainers":[{"trainer":"multipleChoice","calculator":true,"instruction":{"text":"Entscheide, ob die Vektoren <mat>rarrow(u)</mat> und <mat>rarrow(v)</mat> kollinear zueinander sind.","sound":"Entscheide, ob die Vektoren u und v kollinear zueinander sind."},"shuffleButtons":false,"image":{"width":250},"atoms":[{"a":"<mat>rarrow(u) = vector(12, -24, 36)</mat> ,&nbsp;&nbsp;<mat>rarrow(v) = vector(4, -8, 12)</mat>","b":["++kollinear","nicht kollinear"]},{"a":"<mat>rarrow(u) = vector(1.1, -2.2, 2.2)</mat> ,&nbsp;&nbsp;<mat>rarrow(v) = vector(2.2, -4.4, 8.9)</mat>","b":["kollinear","++nicht kollinear"]},{"a":"<mat>rarrow(u) = vector(-0.6, 1.2, -1.8)</mat> ,&nbsp;&nbsp;<mat>rarrow(v) = vector(0.3, -0.6, 0.9)</mat>","b":["++kollinear","nicht kollinear"]},{"a":"<mat>rarrow(u) = vector(2.5, 0, -1.5)</mat> ,&nbsp;&nbsp;<mat>rarrow(v) = vector(-1.25, 0, 0.75)</mat>","b":["++kollinear","nicht kollinear"]}]},{"trainer":"multipleChoice","calculator":true,"instruction":{"text":"Wähle <u>alle</u> Vektoren aus, die zu <mat>rarrow(u)</mat> kollinear sind.","sound":"Wähle alle Vektoren aus, die zu u kollinear sind."},"shuffleButtons":false,"image":{"width":250},"atoms":[{"a":"<mat>rarrow(u) = vector(1.5, -3, 4.5)</mat>","b":["++<mat>rarrow(v_1)=vector(-3, 6, -9)</mat>","<mat>rarrow(v_2)=vector(1.5, 3, 4.5)</mat>","++<mat >rarrow(v_3)=vector(0.75, -1.5, 2.25)</mat>"]},{"a":"<mat>rarrow(u) = vector(-2.4, 0.8, 1.2)</mat>","b":["<mat >rarrow(v_1)=vector(2.4, -0.8, 1.2)</mat>","++<mat >rarrow(v_2)=vector(1.2, -0.4, -0.6)</mat>","++<mat >rarrow(v_3)=vector(-4.8, 1.6, 2.4)</mat>"]},{"a":"<mat>rarrow(u) = vector(3/5, 9, -3)</mat>","b":["++<mat >rarrow(v_1)=vector(-6/5, -18, 6)</mat>","<mat >rarrow(v_2)=vector(9/10, 6, -3)</mat>","++<mat >rarrow(v_3)=vector(9/5, 27, -9)</mat>"]},{"a":"<mat>rarrow(u) = vector(33, -66, 11)</mat>","b":["<mat >rarrow(v_1)=vector(33, 66, -11)</mat>","++<mat >rarrow(v_2)= vector(-16.5, 33, -5.5)</mat>","<mat >rarrow(v_3)=vector(66, -122, 22)</mat>"]}]},{"trainer":"dragMatch","calculator":true,"instruction":{"text":"Welche Vektoren sind kollinear zueinander? Ordne sie zu."},"atoms":[{"a":"<mat>vector(-4,0,-17)</mat>","b":"<mat>vector(1,0,4.25)</mat>"},{"a":"<mat>vector(9/8,-1,1.25)</mat>","b":"<mat>vector( 9, –8, 10)</mat>"},{"a":"<mat>vector( 12, –24, 18 )</mat>","b":"<mat>vector( 6, –12, 9 )</mat>"}]}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Vektoren","path":"/../c-mat-11-algebra/topic-02-vektoren/topic","puid":"c-mat-11-algebra/j8z5pp"},"parentBlock":{"title":"Kollinearität","path":"/../c-mat-11-algebra/topic-02-vektoren/block-07-kollineariteat/block","puid":"c-mat-11-algebra/zn2q01"},"mediaFiles":{"sounds":[{"fileId":"sound/de/f5_2025/Entscheide, ob die Vektoren u und v kollinear zueinander sind.","etag":"554f-18024"},{"fileId":"sound/de/f5_2025/Welche Vektoren sind kollinear zueinander? Ordne sie zu.","etag":"377f-16044"},{"fileId